{"suttaId":"tha-ap469","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1402,1425],"vripara":"32"},"segments":{"tha-ap469:0.3":"Labujaphaladāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap469:1.1":"“Nagare bandhumatiyā, ārāmiko ahaṃ tadā;","tha-ap469:1.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, gacchantaṃ anilañjase.","tha-ap469:2.1":"“Labujaṃ phalamādāya, buddhaseṭṭhassadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap469:2.3":"Ākāseva ṭhito santo, paṭiggaṇhi mahāyaso.","tha-ap469:3.1":"“Vittisañjanano mayhaṃ, diṭṭhadhammasukhāvaho;","tha-ap469:3.3":"Phalaṃ buddhassa datvāna, vippasannena cetasā.","tha-ap469:4.1":"“Adhigañchiṃ tadā pītiṃ, vipulaṃ sukhamuttamaṃ;","tha-ap469:4.3":"Uppajjateva [uppajjate me (syā.)] ratanaṃ, nibbattassa tahiṃ tahiṃ.","tha-ap469:5.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ phalaṃ adadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap469:5.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap469:6.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap469:7.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap469:8.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap469:9.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā labujaphaladāyako thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap469:10.1":"Labujaphaladāyakattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
